   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Runner config.toml (reviewed as security policy)\nallowed_images: registry.example.internal/ai-hardened/*\nallowed_services: same\nallowed_pull_policies: [always]\nhelper_image: mirrored internally\nlimit and concurrent: from pilot load data\nRun untagged off. Max timeout 1800 s.",
   "originalText": "Runner config.toml (reviewed as security policy)\nallowed_images: registry.example.internal/ai-hardened/*\nallowed_services: same\nallowed_pull_policies: [always]\nhelper_image: mirrored internally\nlimit and concurrent: from pilot load data\nRun untagged off. Max timeout 1800 s.",
