   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Excluded from ai-base\napt, dnf, apk, pip\ncompilers, build tools\nssh, scp, nc, wget, sudo, docker, kubectl\nsetuid and setgid binaries\nAI SDKs (use a reviewed derived image)\nSecrets, tokens, environment URLs",
   "originalText": "Excluded from ai-base\napt, dnf, apk, pip\ncompilers, build tools\nssh, scp, nc, wget, sudo, docker, kubectl\nsetuid and setgid binaries\nAI SDKs (use a reviewed derived image)\nSecrets, tokens, environment URLs",
